  "description": "Each YITAMOTOR tonneau cover is custom-built to fit your truck perfectly, ensuring an exact and secure fit. Crafted from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl, these covers are engineered to withstand the elements, providing durability and long-lasting performance. Unlike other covers, YITAMOTOR tonneau covers will not stretch, fade, or crack, keeping your truck bed protected and looking sharp for years to come.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New body style\n5.7 ft beds w/o Rambox and Split Tailgate\nFeatures\nPrecision Fit: This tonneau cover is designed for Ram 1500 New body style 6.4' bed of 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 with 5.7 ft beds w/o Rambox and Split Tailgate; It ensures a snug fit and dependable coverage whether you're tackling daily jobs or weekend getaways\nStreamlined Look, Enhanced Style: This low-profile truck bed cover follows your pickup's contours, providing a clean, polished look and reliable cargo protection\nFunctional Quad-Fold Design: More flexible than traditional tri-fold covers, this hard quad-fold design allows up to 3/4 access to your truck bed; It is ideal for hauling bulky tools and outdoor gear\nOne-Handed Easy Access: Quickly open your truck bed with a simple latch; No need to move around your vehicle; Designed for effortless one-handed operation, this bed cover speeds up loading and unloading so you can get going faster\nDurable & Weather-Ready: Engineered with weather seals and drainage tubes, this truck cover offers year-round protection from rain, dirt, and road debris, keeping your cargo secure in any climate",
